om/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-24T03:19:48Z","updated_at":"2025-07-24T03:19:48Z","body":"Does the issue go away if you search for a term in the \"Search files...\" bar? As far as I can tell, what's happening is that there is a behavior difference between having the Addons toggle selected and unselected that isn't always communicated.\n\nWhen the Addons toggle is off, if the search bar is empty, a list of (all?) scene files in the project is displayed.\n\nWhen the Addons toggle is off, if the search bar is empty, a list of recently used scene files is displayed.\n\nEntering something in the search bar will let you select the file you want. The reason I figured this out is that in a fresh project, when you haven't ever selected something, it does give you a message that says you need to search for something. Even then, I stared at it blankly for 10 seconds waiting for it to scan my filesystem before I actually read the message 😅\n\nI would agree this is a UX issue, personally. I didn't find the behavior intuitive.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3111823019/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]